{
  "9851": {
    "en": [
      "Bani, Binapani, O merciful one!",
      "You gave the blind man eyes, then cast him into darkness —",
      "having granted a glimpse, where have you hidden, O goddess?",
      "If you would vanish like a dream, why did you give him consciousness?",
      "Showing yourself only for a fleeting instant — an undying ache of the heart —",
      "he wanders seeking you; look, there, from grove to grove."
