  "9852": {
    "en": [
      "Here I behold you, O goddess of mine!",
      "All the universe, moving and still, is steeped in poetry —",
      "I see everything radiant with beauty.",
      "In rhythm the moon ascends, in rhythm the golden sun rises,",
      "in rhythm the circling worlds move on,",
      "the stars are all blazing poems;",
      "and amid this poetry, who are you, O goddess,",
      "darkening the light with light?",
      "Today the south wind is restless — what song is it singing from wood to wood?",
      "The flowers tell the story of the heart,",
      "new melodies surge and overflow —",
      "in this joy today my heart sings its songs, all unbarred.",
      "Is it you, goddess Bharati, who by your grace opened these blind eyes,",
      "who brought the dawn into the darkness of my soul,",
      "who taught me the melodies of Nature?",
      "Blessed are you —",
      "forever shall I remain, clasping your feet."
    ],
